360
00:20:46,319 --> 00:20:47,240
Three years.

361
00:20:48,640 --> 00:20:49,440
By the way, Dad,

362
00:20:49,680 --> 00:20:51,519
Jiaojiao will be back soon.

363
00:20:51,519 --> 00:20:53,160
