384
00:21:45,240 --> 00:21:46,079
Ah.

385
00:21:46,079 --> 00:21:47,960
That's just

386
00:21:48,039 --> 00:21:49,200
his wishful thinking.

387
00:21:49,200 --> 00:21:51,759
are just his wishful thinking.

388
00:21:52,400 --> 00:21:53,200
I just

389
