400
00:22:18,640 --> 00:22:19,559
Congratulations!

401
00:22:19,640 --> 00:22:20,880
Haha, congratulations!

402
00:22:20,880 --> 00:22:21,640
Mr. Cheng, congratulations!

403
00:22:21,640 --> 00:22:22,319
Congratulations!

404
00:22:22,319 --> 00:22:22,839
Congratulations!

405
00:22:22,839 --> 00:22:23,440
Dad.

406
00:22:26,359 --> 00:22:27,079
Good.

407
00:22:27,759 --> 00:22:29,000
