457
00:24:10,319 --> 00:24:11,839
Miss Yan, hold on tight.

458
00:24:11,839 --> 00:24:12,519
Go!

459
00:24:20,759 --> 00:24:21,519
So,

460
00:24:21,799 --> 00:24:24,759
Su Yuejiao and the escort went to Ning'an County,

461
