516
00:26:58,640 --> 00:27:00,279
Miss Yan, we've arrived at Cheng Mansion.

517
00:27:00,279 --> 00:27:01,720
You can tidy up in the carriage first.

518
00:27:01,759 --> 00:27:02,759
I'll keep watch outside.

519
00:27:08,400 --> 00:27:11,000
Miss Yan, are you feeling unwell?

520
00:27:20,440 --> 00:27:21,400
