522
00:27:27,759 --> 00:27:28,880
She just ran into the city.

523
00:27:28,880 --> 00:27:29,799
She was afraid of being late.

524
00:27:29,799 --> 00:27:30,720
She didn't waste a moment.

525
00:27:31,039 --> 00:27:31,440
Oh, no.

526
00:27:31,440 --> 00:27:32,119
Oh, no.

527
00:27:32,119 --> 00:27:33,920
