542
00:28:17,240 --> 00:28:18,799
We are willing to follow you.

543
00:28:23,359 --> 00:28:24,359
Be an escort.

544
00:28:40,400 --> 00:28:41,079
Young Master Cheng,

545
00:28:41,440 --> 00:28:42,000
I'll find

546
00:28:42,000 --> 00:28:43,200
