00:29:41,400 --> 00:29:42,480
You can kiss the bride,

577
00:29:42,480 --> 00:29:43,640
and I can finish the escort mission.

578
00:29:44,319 --> 00:29:45,160
Two birds with one stone.

579
00:29:45,279 --> 00:29:46,599
Chief Escort Su

580
00:29:47,039 --> 00:29:47,759
Don't bother.

581
00:29:48,200 --> 00:29:49,240
She'll be fine.

582
00:29:50,119 --> 00:29:51,119
How do you know?

583
00:29:51,720 --> 00:29:54,400
Look at the neat wedding dress.

584
00:29:54,400 --> 00:29:55,279
It's placed on the carriage.

585
00:29:55,359 --> 00:29:57,640
Obviously, she has planned it all along.

586
00:29:57,640 --> 00:29:58,519
She ran away.

587
00:29:59,759 --> 00:30:00,519
She eloped?

588
00:30:00,519 --> 00:30:00,920
Yes.

589
00:30:07,720 --> 00:30:08,519
Let's go.

590
00:30:09,680 --> 00:30:10,359
Rocks in the way.

591
00:30:10,359 --> 00:30:11,039
We're cleaning them up.

592
00:30:11,039 --> 00:30:12,359
We won't be late for your auspicious hour.

593
00:30:19,799 --> 00:30:21,079
Chief Escort Su,

594
00:30:21,079 --> 00:30:22,839
I don't have time to explain now.

595
00:30:22,839 --> 00:30:24,000
After I finish this escort,

596
00:30:24,000 --> 00:30:25,200
I'll give you the escort fee as usual.

597
00:30:25,200 --> 00:30:25,799
No need to report to the authorities,

598
00:30:25,799 --> 00:30:26,559
nor to compensate.

599
00:30:26,559 --> 00:30:27,680
How about killing two birds with one stone?

600
00:30:32,359 --> 00:30:34,279
Chief Escort Su,

601
00:30:35,039 --> 00:30:36,440
I'm begging you.

602
00:30:37,119 --> 00:30:39,400
My future happiness depends on you.

603
00:30:40,359 --> 00:30:41,160
Hmm.
